WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.676
Completeness and uniqueness are different problems
Completeness asks

00:00:05.702 --> 00:00:11.442
whether needed values are present The seriousness
depends on the field and the use case

00:00:12.376 --> 00:00:18.925
Missing email may be acceptable while missing
patient ID may be critical Uniqueness

00:00:18.951 --> 00:00:24.687
asks whether one real-world entity appears more than
intended Exact

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:30.229
duplicate rows are easy to detect Duplicate entities
under different identifiers

00:00:30.255 --> 00:00:35.858
are harder and may require entity-resolution methods
Always distinguish

00:00:35.871 --> 00:00:38.410
missing information from repeated identity
